<item><title>Eswatini U-23 team beats Algeria</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-u-23-team-beats-algeria-c776e4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-u-23-team-beats-algeria-c776e4/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>The national Under-23 football team&apos;s victory over Algeria has boosted national pride after a series of poor senior team performances.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:42:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini names Cebisile Ngwenya to lead co-operatives department</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-names-cebisile-ngwenya-to-lead-co-operatives-17d648/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-names-cebisile-ngwenya-to-lead-co-operatives-17d648/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>The magistrate and former High Court official replaces the late Russell Nxumalo, who died in October 2025, as the sector faces financial and governance strain.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
